    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/33_attack.png"
    "For reasons beyond knowing, a monster appears before the girl a third time."
    "She grips her spear tightly, red eyes shining out from her impassive face."
    "She dispatches the fo with ease a single strike."
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/34_elevator.png"
    "Stale air spills out from the other side of the door. It is an elevator."
    "Hearing it creak to life, the girl closes her eyes."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/35_crimson-room.png"
    "Illuminated in crimson, the room is enveloped in an odd atmosphere."
    "The device in the middle of the room is filled with shimmering liquid."
    "Suspended in the flux is an oddly-shaped spear."
    "Upon another crystal statue a note lay before her."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/36_note.png"
    "- Scrap of a Torn Note -"
    "I have made a terrible mistake. I've had everything all wrong from the very beginning. I thought this was just another facet of all the weapons research that was going on at the time.
    There is no longer much that I can do, but I must fulfill my duty all the same.
    I must show her the truth."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/37_reaching.png"
    "She sees a card beside a small piece of paper."
    "She knows it is the key that opens the wall, and takes it."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/38_memory.png"
    "The memory she receives is of the beginning."
    "The first of the living-weapon sisters."
    "The eldest of her sisters had lost control and birthed the aberrations."
    "This was the cause of the facility's destruction."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/39_memory.png"
    "The memories tie together. She feels her sisters' emotions race through her."
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/40_memories_tied.png"
    "Enduring the flood of images, she presses on."
    "She now understands that her eldest sister still suffers."
