    #Story 4 Start
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/41_story_4.png"
    "Story 4: ...From Recursion"
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/42_establishing_shot.png"
    "She continues to move down the long and winding path."
    "She knows the answers she seeks are waiting for her somewhere up ahead..."
    "And that her sister is waiting as well."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/43_note.png"
    "- Scrap of a Torn Note -"
    "We came upon an abandoned research facility during today's investigation. Judging by the documents that were left behind, my guess is the place was used for researching genetics and living organisms.
    It would be remiss of me not to mention one object that was of particular note—a fully functioning cryogenic sleep chamber with 'Eleanor' engraved on the side."
    "After the higher-ups make their final call on how to address the matter tomorrow, we will perform a thorough investigation of the chamber's interior. I hope against hope that this discovery will mean great things for our future and for all of mankind."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/44_monster.png"
    "When she enters the room, she spies a massive something at its heart."
    "It is the leader of the aberrations."
    "But it is more that that."
    "It is also her older sister; the one who lost control."
    "Her eldest sister spreads her white wings and howls in a ferocious voice."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/45_monster_1.png"
    "This cry of enmity toward the world shakes the entire facility to its foundation."
    "A death rattle hisses from her massive throat."
    
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/46_defeated.png"
    "Her body falls to the floor."
    "The sisters' duel is over."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/47_to_crystal.png"
    "As her elder transforms into crystal, the girl slowly brings up her hand."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/48_first_memory.png"
    "Her sister's memories race through her like a tide."
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/49_second_memory.png"
    ""

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/50_continue.png"
    "She sees it, then: The place she must go."
    "It was a precious place to the older sister when she was still human."
    "Plucking her sister's sword from the floor, she whispers,"
    "Leave all to me."

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/51_to_outside_world.png"
    "She makes her way to the outside world, toward the place of memory."
    
